  "implementation_summary": [
    "Added a pure in-memory shipment reducer with no HTTP, database, clock, or notification-send side effect.",
    "Closed the event vocabulary to SHIPMENT_NOT_PICKED_UP, SHIPMENT_PICKED_UP, and SHIPMENT_DELIVERED.",
    "Kept pre-deadline NOT_PICKED_UP ON_TRACK; promoted at-deadline or overdue events to AT_RISK with follow-up and supervisor candidates.",
    "Made PICKED_UP move the shipment to IN_TRANSIT and complete the matching fulfillment promise without resolving the case.",
    "Allowed DELIVERED only from IN_TRANSIT and emitted a terminal completed/resolved outcome.",
    "Applied event high-watermark, equal-time legality, exact replay, conflicting event-id, terminal replay, and no-mutation rejection rules.",
    "Synchronized the three next-update projections and prevented an already-past promise from being returned."
  ],
